            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper expounds the imaging methods, mechanism of action, hemodynamic responses, efficacy and side effects of three pharmacologic stressors (dipyridamole, adenosine and dobutamine) for clinical use in experiment of diagnosis, thus providing vital reference materials for clinical pharmacologic stress myocardial perfusion imaging.</AbstractText>
